\description{
Makes a spatial analysis again on another segmentation of its dataset, in one step, in the Spatial view: the two segmentations compared (unless they are), its labels made again from the same clustering parameters and marker set (or reference), its graph built again with the same definition over the same regions' cells, and the question asked with the same parameters, regions and window. The new analysis is recorded as made from the first. Answers the two read together: each number under both (keyed by label and gene names), the change, the numbers' rank correlation, and the largest changes. Labels imported, curated or in a consensus, and niches, are not made again.
}
